msgid "Language support plugins"
msgstr "Engadidos para soporte de idiomas"

msgid ""
"This menu lets you manage KOReader's language support plugins and their "
"associated settings.\n"
"\n"
"These plugins provide language-specific helpers to KOReader, to improve the "
"reading experience with languages that require some extra handling when "
"compared to most European languages.\n"
"\n"
"In order to disable a language plugin, you need to disable it from the "
"Plugin Management menu."
msgstr ""
"Este menú permite xestionar os engadidos de soporte de idioma de KOReader a "
"as súas configuracións asociadas.\n"
"\n"
"Estes engadidos proporcionan axudantes específicos de idioma a KOReader, "
"para mellorar a experiencia de lectura con linguaxes que requiren algún "
"procesado adicional comparados coa meirande parte dos idiomas europeos.\n"
"\n"
"Para desactivar un engadido de idioma, hai que facelo desde o menú de "
"Xestión de Engadidos."

