"- **Shift** + **Down**: Book map\n"
"- **B** or **Shift** + **Left**: Bookmarks, notes and highlights\n"
"- **Shift** + **Press**: Save current page to location history\n"
"- **Shift** + **Home**: Toggle wifi on/off\n"
"- **Shift** + **Back**: Switch to previously opened book\n"
"\n"
"When using a virtual keyboard:\n"
"\n"
"- **Shift** + **Right**: Move cursor to right char\n"
"- **Shift** + **Left**: Move cursor to left char\n"
"- **Shift** + **Press**: Show special characters behind virtual keyboard "
"keys\n"
"- **Shift** + **Home**: Toggle virtual keyboard on/off\n"
"- **Shift** + **Del**: Delete word\n"
"- **Shift** + **Back**: Delete whole line\n"
"- **Sym** + **Alphabet keys**: symbols, numbers and special characters\n"
msgstr ""
"## Atallos <a id=\"short\"></a>\n"
"\n"
"A seguinte é unha lista non exhaustiva dos atallos dispoñibles.\n"
"\n"
"Dentro do módulo de lectura:\n"
"\n"
"- **T** or **Shift** + **Up**: Índice\n"
"- **Shift** + **Right**: Engadir marcador\n"
"- **Shift** + **Down**: Mapa do libro\n"
"- **B** or **Shift** + **Left**: Marcadores, notas e textos destacados\n"
"- **Shift** + **Press**: Garda a páxina actual ao historial de "
"localizacións\n"
"- **Shift** + **Home**: Conmutar wifi\n"
"- **Shift** + **Back**: Cambiar ao libro aberto anteriormente\n"
"\n"
"Cando se usa un teclado virtual:\n"
"\n"
"- **Shift** + **Right**: Mover o cursor ao carácter da dereita\n"
"- **Shift** + **Left**: Mover o cursor ao carácter da esquerda\n"
"- **Shift** + **Press**: Mostrar os caracteres especiais tras as teclas do "
"teclado virtual\n"
"- **Shift** + **Home**: Conmutar teclado virtual\n"
"- **Shift** + **Del**: Borrar palabra\n"
"- **Shift** + **Back**: Borrar toda a liña\n"
"- **Sym** + **Alphabet keys**: Símbolos, números e caracteres especiais\n"

msgid ""
"## Frontlight/backlight <a id=\"flight\"></a>\n"
"\n"
"You can control your screen light via this menu. If you have warm lighting "
"(normal white LEDs+orange ones) you can control them separately from this "
"dialog:\n"
"\n"
"> **TOP MENU ➔ ![Settings](resources/icons/mdlight/appbar.settings.svg) ➔ "
"Frontlight**\n"
